Bot1.Hand.Blood Sun.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Pass
